Comment: JetBrains Mono NL Nerd Font, regular and bold, embedded in the binary.
 CORE §2 records them as bundled assets rather than dependencies. `NL` is the
 no-ligature cut, because a filename holding `->` must render as the two
 characters the archive stores.

